factorWeylAlgebra1 -- give one factorisation of a Weyl algebra element
**********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        factorWeylAlgebra1 r
  * Inputs:
      * r, the ring element

Description
===========

Produces one possible factorisation of the element r of a Weyl algebra. This is
a shortcut for *note factorWeylAlgebra: factorWeylAlgebra, with optional
argument StopAfter=>1. Note that alternate strategies are used if only a finite
number of factorisation is required, so it may take much less time to compute,
as on this example:

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = makeWA(QQ[x,y])                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing, 2 differential variable(s)                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : u=dx^3+x^2-8; v=1/2*dx; U=u^2+4*v; V=u^3+3*(u*v+v*u);  -- V^2==U^3+8    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : factorWA1(U*V)                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|        6     2  3    4        2       3      2               9     2  6     |
|o6 = (dx  + 2x dx  + x  + 6x*dx  - 16dx  - 16x  + 8dx + 64)(dx  + 3x dx  +   |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : Expression of class Product                                             |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|  4  3    6         5       6      3  2      2  3      4       4      2      |
|3x dx  + x  + 18x*dx  - 24dx  + 18x dx  - 48x dx  - 24x  + 39dx  + 45x dx -  |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|       2        3       2                                                    |
|144x*dx  + 192dx  + 192x  + 27x - 168dx - 512)                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

